<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Yaka - Lilasina lilinyatii</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa tsiomi kwaa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa tsiomi kwaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuumbu ya Timoteo bali mu uyaabisa yo mu taanga kimi mu mukaanda Biyiluu bia batumu na mikaanda mia Pawuli. Mu ngwanya, Timoteo wakiyili Pawuli mu isala. Timoteo ayili Pawuli mu midieenge mialaa. Ninha Pawuli ahiiri nde bisala bialaa biamifuri, vulu-vulu ku vulu la Tesalonika na ku vulu la Kolito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asonii mikaanda mioolo na atsindii mio kwaa Timoteo. Basonuu mio mundaa ibwa kia imiini mu ikristo ya makwa ba. Isala kimaasaala kia ubweeyese libuundu na uhamisa imiini kia balibuundu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda wa tsiomi li mu uha <char style="em">madoongi kwaa balibuundu, kwaa bakuutu</char> na <char style="em">kwaa Timoteo</char> nde makulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwaana kaba la balibuundu, lili mu uyene ayiisi nziisili ya pia kwaa bangaa imiini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-7">1.3-7</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:1-4">4.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:3-5">6.3-5</ref></char>). Matsimi ma kaba lii mali mu umweese ti mbayili ya biloo bia nha tsi a yabweeye pe. Ni mu buu, bo bali mu ubisi makweele na utsoro biloo bikimi. Ka bunu, biloo bioosi bi Nziaambi ayiluu bili bibibwe. Timoteo afwaana ulibili libuundu moonyi mu ndaa yii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mabuundu ma Kristo mamaatuungumu. Mo mali na bakuutu. Ni bakuutu ba libuundu, na bakebi ba libuundu bali mu ubaasila bawele na babeeri, na bakuutu ba mabuundu bali uyiisi mandaa ma Nziaambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mabuundu maa mali na nzala ya udiaala kutso idzuunu, na baata ba tsi bafwaana umono kinyi mu mo. Musonii a mukaanda wu, li mu uha mandoongi mu ndaa ya tala likutunu na likuundu (kiiti kia <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2">2</ref></char>). Nde li mu uyaabisa ka buni bakuutu ba libuundu bafwaana udiaata (kiiti kia <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 3">3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Taayi a Timoteo musi Eleene, na nguu a nde Mukristo wa Muyuudayo. Pawuli ayiisi Timoteo, na nde li weti mwaana kwaa Pawuli. Nde ka mukuutu a mabuundu. Mukaanda wu, li mu uloombo kwaa nde mu uba musiali wumubwe wa Yiisu Kristo. Mukaanda li mu uyiisi ka kwaa Timoteo, buni nde utuu ubaasila balibuundu, na buni nde afwaana uyiisi na utumu kwaa mosi mosi mu bo (kiiti kia <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 4">4</ref></char> natee kia <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 6">6</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Me Pawuli, tumu a Yiisu Kristo weti buli litumu la Nziaambi, Muyobili a bisi, na la Yiisu Kristo ilimbisi kia bisi. <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Me nitsinduu mukaanda wu kwaa Timoteo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Timoteo </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Biy 16.1</ref></char></note>, mwaana a me wa ngwanya mu imiini: Nyaala Nziaambi Taayi na Yiisu Kristo Pfumu a bisi baha we bweese, mbweeyili na iyeenge!<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usa mayele na nziisili ya pia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Nha me nakiyene ku Masedwane<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Masedwane </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:16">2Ko 1.16</ref></char></note>, me natumi we, mu usaala ku ngaanda a Efeso<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Efeso </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:8">2Ko 1.8</ref></char></note>. Mundaa ti, mu ngaanda yii, uli na baata babali mu uyiisi nziisili ya pia. Ha bo litumu, la unyaala nziisili yii! <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Leele bo banyaala ukaangama mu matsaba matala bukulu ba bakaa, mamali uwa pe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4-5">Mba 4—5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 9-11">9—11</ref></char></note>. Mandaa maa, mali mu ubee ndila ma makaama, nha mbuu ya usalila minhana mia liyobolo la Nziaambi, mi buyaaba mu imiini mu nde.<verse eid="1TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Ndutu a tumini yii, ni mu ubutusu litoono, lili mu umata mu mutimi watsieeme, mu matsimi mamabwe na mu imiini kia ngwanya. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Baata babamosi bamaasiisi kuulu yii, na bamaadiimbili kutso bimoo biahele a ndaanda. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bo batoono umweese ti, bo bayiisi ba mikele mia Nziaambi. Ka bo a bayaaba tsutulu a mandaa ma bo makulu bali mu uleele, na so mandaa ma bo bali mu uyaabisa mu ilimbisi kioosi.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Bisi diayaaba ti mikele mimibwe mili, mbiiti diayaaba ndutu a mio. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Dilibilani moonyi ti: Nziaambi a ahi pe Mikele mia nde mundaa baata balibweeye. Ka nde ahi mio mundaa baata babali mu uhele utumumu nde, mundaa baata babahele na inziaambi, na baata bangaa buhaangi, na bangaa masumu. Nziaambi ahi mio, mundaa baata bali mu uhele ukiinzi nde. Nde ahi mio, mundaa babali mu udusu bataayi ba bo, so a buu pe banguu ba bo, na mundaa a badusi. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Nde ahi mio, mundaa bangaa tsoongili, mundaa babaala babali mu usoongo na bambayi babaala, mundaa bayalii ba baata mu butee. Mio mili ka mundaa bangaa pia na mundaa babali mu ulaba mikisi mia pia. Nde ahi mio, mundaa baata babali mu usa mandaa moosi ku buko nha kulu a nziisili ya ngwanya. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Nziisili yii yili mu tso Ndaa Yimbwe ya Nziaambi wa buzuti, yi ba heeri me, yo yili ndaa wa makinyi.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutili a matoondo mu bubwe ba Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Me ndi mu uvutulu matoondo kwaa Yiisu Kristo, Pfumu a bisi waha me bweese bafwaana mu ukuusu isala kia me. Me ndi mu uvutulu nde matoondo bu amono ti, me ndi muutu wu nde afwaana uholo mu isala kia nde. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />So bu yili ti me nakileele mandaa mamabi mu nde taanga dialuti, mukwaamisi, na natuyi nde, ka Nziaambi akwiilili me ngebe mu mundaa ti me nakiyiluu buu kutso bundimbi, bu nali nahele na imiini<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">nakiyiluu </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Biy 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4-5">9.4-5</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Pfumu a bisi aluusi me mu bweese bafwaabala. Nde ahi me imiini na litoono bili mu umata mu itwaari na Yiisu Kristo.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Mono, ndaa yi yili ya ngwanya, yi baata boosi bafwaana usa imiini mu yo: Yiisu Kristo ayiiri mu tsi mu uyobolo bangaa masumu. Me ndi watsiomi nha kati a bo. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ka ni mubuu, Nziaambi amweesi libweeye la nde kwaa me. Nde atooni ti Yiisu Kristo amweese kamini a mutimi a nde yoosi mu me, me wuli wavulu mu masumu. Ki ni ifwaani kwaa babakaasa imiini mu nde, mu taanga dikaayira, na sa baholo moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi.<verse eid="1TI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Nyaala likiinzi na buzitu biba mu taanga dioosi kwaa Mutini wa bilimi na bilimi, wu uhele ukwa, wu bali mu uhele umono, na Nziaambi ndila mosi! Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udwaana mudiingi wumubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoteo, mwaana a me, me niha we tumini di, weti buli mbilili yibayaabisi mu mataanga malutu mu we. Nyaala mandaa maa, maba mifuri mia we mu mudiingi wumubwe, wu we udwaana. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Kebe imiini na matsimi matsieeme. Baata babamosi babisi uyuu matsimi ma bo matsieeme na badiaamisi imiini kia bo, weti bu luungu libaadiaama mu maamba. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Nha kati a baata baa uli na Imene<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Imene </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:17">2Ti 2.17</ref></char></note> na Alekandere<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Alekandere </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:14">2Ti 4.14</ref></char></note>. Me nayeelili bo kwaa Saatina<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">nayeelili bo kwaa Saatina </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:5">1Ko 5.5</ref></char></note>, paa bo bayii bwa uhele utuu Nziaambi.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nziisili mu ndaa yatala likuundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Ndaa ya kati a tsiomi yi me nitumu ni yi: diloombo kwaa Nziaambi, dikuundu, dipele na divutulu nde matoondo mundaa a baata boosi. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Dikuundani mundaa mitini na mu baata boosi babali na litumu, paa ti, bisi diba na idiingi kia izuunu, kia iyeenge, kia likiinzi, kutso ukangama mu Nziaambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Yii ni ndaa yimbwe na yili mu uyaangisa Nziaambi Muyobili a bisi, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />nde watoono ti baata boosi bayobuu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:23">Ezk 18.23</ref></char></note> na bato ku nziaabili ya ngwanya.<verse eid="1TI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Mundaa ti uli na Nziaambi ndila moosi, uli na ndila muutu mosi wuli mu uvuutu itwaari nha kati a baata na Nziaambi. Muutu wuu ni Yiisu Kristo, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />wayeelili nyutu a nde makulu weti mufutu, mu ndaa ukuulu baata boosi. Ni mu buu, mu taanga di Nziaambi atooni, nde asi ti Yiisu aba imbaangi kia libweeye la nde. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Ni mu buu, Nziaambi abiaalisi me mu uyaabisa Ndaa Yimbwe weti muyiisi na tumu a Yiisu Kristo, mundaa uyiisi imiini na ngwanya kwaa baata babali a mu ifuumbu kia ba Bayuudayo pe. Me a pia pe ndi mu uleele, ka ngwanya.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Me natoono ti, mu mambuu moosi baata banaangila mioo miatsieeme ku yulu mu likuundu, kwahele a kesi, so muheebili wa makaama.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Bu mosi ka, mu taanga di bakaasa bali mu ukuundu, bo bafwaana ulwaata ndwaatili ya likiinzi, yakuluu, na yafwaana. Banyaala ukutu naanga dia nzala umonuu, so ulwaata bilungu bia woolo, so bilaba bia vulu bubwe, na bikutu bia tala yalaa. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Ka bo bafwaana umweese libweeye la bo, mu mandaa moosi mamabwe ma bo bali mu uyiluu. Ni buu bakaasa babalasina ukiinzi Nziaambi, bafwaana uyiluu. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Nyaala bakaasa bayuu nziisili kutso ukuluu na bafwaana udiaala na pii. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Me utuu pe uha muswa kwaa mukaasa mu uyiisi nha kulu a babaala: nde afwaana uba na pii. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Mu ngwanya, Aadami bakwiyiluu watsiomi, tumake Eva. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />A Aadami pe Saatina afuti, ka mukaasa asiingi bafutu nde, bu uheli utumumu tumini dia Nziaambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Ka, mukaasa sa ayobuu mundaa ti nde sa abutu baana. So nde diaali mutso imiini, na mutso litoono, na kutso ndiaatili ya tsieemini na ndiaatili ya buleembi.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bakuutu ba libuundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Dimono ndaa ya ngwanya: so muutu tooni uba mukebi a libuundu, nde tooni usa isala ki ibwe. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Mukebi a libuundu afwaana mu uba muutu wahele a toono na nde afwaana ukaangama mu mukari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tit 1.6-9</ref></char>.</note> ndila mosi. Nde afwaana mu uba na mbeelili yimbwe, wa buleembi, wa likiinzi na muutu wu uyaka bieenyi na nde afwaana uyaaba uyiisi. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Anyaala uba munywiiri a mala, so a buu pe ngaa ituusi. Ka nde afwaana uba, muutu wakuluu na wa iyeenge. Anyaala uba watoono mboongo kwaa laa! <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Aba muutu wu utumu nzo a nde bubwe. Baana ba nde bafwaana mu utumumu nde kutso likiinzi loosi. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Mu ngwanya, so muutu atuyi utumu nzo a nde makulu pe, buni nde utuu ubiti libuundu la Nziaambi? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Nde anyaala uba muutu wu maakiingili mayele liili, leeti nde saa aluulu mu liwaa, na sa amana kutso tsieembili weti bu basieembi Saatina. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Bwafwaana ka ti babahele uba ba ngaa Kristo bata imbaangi ki ibwe mu nde, paa bahele umeengele nde na anyaala ubwa mu mieete mia Saatina.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakebi ba libuundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Pili mosi ka, bakebi ba libuundu bafwaana uba baata ba likiinzi, na babuta ngwanya. Bo a bafwaana pe unywa mala kwa mifuri, so usaa mboongo mu makuulu mamabi. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Nyaala bo baba babakaangama mu matsweeyi ma imiini mu Nziaambi, na mu matsimi matsieeme. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Bwafwaana mu ukwakengese ndiaatili a bo, tumake so a uli na ndaa ya bisieembi pe, bo utuu usala weti bakebi ba libuundu.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Pili moosi ka, bakebi ba libuundu ba bakaasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bakebi ba libuundu ba bakaasa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">utuu uba bakari ba bakebi so buu pe bakaasa bayaka mbili ya uba bakebi.</char></note>, bafwaana uba balikiinzi, banyaala uba na tsuyili yimbi wa Saatina. Baba ba buleembi, na taanga dioosi, bafwaana usa ilimbisi mu bo. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Bakuutu ba libuundu bafwaana ukweele mukaasa ndila mosi, na bo bafwaana mu utuu utumui baana ba bo na nzo a nde yoosi. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Bakebi ba libuundu babubaasa isala kia ibwe, bubaabili bo kwaa baata. Ni mu yii, bo bali mu utuu uyiisi mu ilimbisi kialaa, mu imiini kili mu uvuutu bisi itwaari mu Yiisu Kristo.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matsweeyi ma manene mali mu uvuutu bisi na Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Me ndi mu usonuu we mukaanda wuunawu, bu ndi na ilimbisi ti taanga hoolo disiaali, me sa yamono we. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Ka so me diingi mu uyiluu buu, miloongo mia mukaanda wu, sa mibaasila we mu uyaaba, buni we afwaana udiaata mu nzo a Nziaambi. Pili mosi, libuundu la Nziaambi wa moonyi, lili kuunzi na ibwa bili mu usuku ngwanya. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Ee-e, mu ngwanya, bisi dili mu uyaabisa nha kulu a baata boosi: ti matsweeyi ma ukangama kwa bisi mu Nziaambi mali mamanene!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kristo...</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Nde amonii mu musunyi weti muutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">nde ayabini walibweeye mu Muheebili wa Ngira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">nde amonii kwaa batumu ba Nziaambi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Bamuyaabisi kwaa bifuumbu bia baata bioosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">bayaki nde mu imiini mu tsi yoosi ya diengelele baata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Bamunaangili mu buzitu!<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bioosi bi Nziaambi ayilii bibibwe bili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Muheebili wa Ngira li mu uleele ndaa yi na yaki-yaki: mu taanga diatsieelele, baata babamosi sa badiimbisi imiini kia bo, mu uduku miheebili mia pia, na nzisili yili mu umata kwaa miheebili mimibi. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Baata bangaa peluu na bangaa pia sa badiimbisi bo. Bo bali weti baata babali na matsimi mabanyeengese mu itali kiabeenge ku mbaa. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Baata baa bali mu uyiisi ti, baata banyaala ukwelesene, na badia ndila biloo bi bo bali mu utumu. Ka Nziaambi ayilii biloo bii, paa ti bangaa imiini babayaaba ngwanya, badia bio mu uvutulu nde matoondo. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Mundaa ti, bioosi bi Nziaambi ayiluu bibibwe bili. A uli na iloo so imosi pe kia ubumu, ka diafwaana uholo bio bioosi mu mvutili a matoondo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:31">Mba 1.31</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Mundaa ti mandaa ma Nziaambi na likuundu bili mu usa ti biloo bii bioosi biba biasieeme.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musiali a Yiisu Kristo wu mubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Timoteo, mbiiti we heeri nziisili yii kwaa baana ba nguu, we sa ba musiali a Yiisu Kristo wu mubwe. So we yilii buu, we sa mweese ti we li mu udia mandaa ma imiini na nziisili ya ngwanya, yi we aduki bubwe-bubwe. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Ka bumu matsaba ma hele na inziaambi mali itaata na imiini, matsaba ma bangooyi, matsaba ma buu a buu. Salila idiingi kia we mu uba wa kangama mu Nziaambi.<verse eid="1TI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Bipa bili mu uha nyutu mifuri bili na ndutu, ka mu mandaa mamakee. Ka ukangama mu Nziaambi ili na ndutu mu mandaa moosi. Mundaa ti kio ili mu uha ilimbisi kia moonyi, na uha bisi ndasina dia moonyi wukaayiri. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Yii na yi, yili ndaa ya ngwanya, na yi baata boosi bafwaana mu uyaka. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Mu ngwanya, so bisi dili mu umono pasi, na so dili mu udwaana, ni mundaa ti, bisi dili na ilimbisi mu Nziaambi wa moonyi. Nde wuli Muyobili a baata boosi, na vulu-vulu wa babasa imiini mu nde.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Tumu na yiisi mandaa maa moosi. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Kele muutu ayameengele we, mundaa ti we mufuru! Ka ba ifwaani kwaa bangaa imiini, mu tsuyili a we, mu ndiaatili a we, mu litoono la we, mu imiini kia we, na mu tsieemini a we. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Tswaamini me niyiri, hama mu utaanga Mandaa ma Ngira nha kulu a baata. Sa mifuri mu uhamisa bo na uyiisi bo. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Ameengele pe bungori ba Muheebili wa Ngira ba we li na bo, ba Nziaambi aheeri we mumbilili nha pfuundu a bakuutu banayi mioo nha yulu a we. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Hama mu uyiluu mii mioosi, ha mutimi a we woosi mu isala ki we li mu usa! Mu buu baata boosi sa bamono ti, we li mu uyene maku-kulu. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Sa mayele mu we makulu na mu nziisili a we. Sa mukonono mu kuulu yi! Mu ngwanya, mbiiti we yilii buu, we sa uyobuu we makulu, na baata babali mu uyuu we.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi kwaa mukuutu a libuundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />A sieembe pe inunu mu ibaala, ka hamisa nde weti ti nde li taayi a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:1">Pal 5.1</ref> </char></note>. Na holo bafuru weti baana ba nguu ba we baba baala, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Bakaasa ba binunu weti ba nguu ba we, na banduumbu weti bakeri ba we. Yiluu buu mu mutimi watsieeme.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Baasila mu likiinzi loosi bakwiili babahele na libaasila. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Ka so mukwiili li na baana so bateeri, bo ni batsiomi babafwaana umweese imiini kia bo mu nzo a bomo. Ni mu buu, bo sa bavutulu kwaa bataayi na banguu ba bo, libaasili li bo baholi kwaa bo. Maa ni mandaa mali mu uha Nziaambi kinyi. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Mukwiili wuli ngwanya nde bake, wahele na muutu wu ubaasila nde, asuusu ilimbisi kia nde mu Nziaambi. Nde li mu ukuundu Nziaambi nyanga na butsuu, mu uloombo libaasila kwaa nde. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ka mukwiili wuli mu uba ndila na matsimi ma uyaangisa mutimi a nde mu manzala ma tsi, nde amaakwakwa, so bu ali moonyi. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Libili bo moonyi mu mandaa maa moosi, paa bo bahele na bisieembi. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />So muutu nyaali mu ubaasila kaanda la nde, na vulu-vulu baata ba nzo a nde, nde maabwiisi imiini kia nde, na nde maavulu mungooyi bubi.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Mu uba mu kaba la bakwiili, bubwe ti mukaasa atooso bilimi maku masamina. Tumake nde afwaana uba mukaasa wali wanambata mu baala limosi. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Na nde afwaana uyabina mu mimibwe mi nde ayilii: nde akulusu baana ba nde bubwe, akiyaka bieenyi bubwe, aswayi mili mia bangaa imiini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aswayi mili mia bangaa imiini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwaa Bayuudayo, uswaa miili mia bieenyi ali iliimbi kia isiaayi </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:44">Luk 7.44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:1-17">Yow 13.1-17</ref></char>.</note>, abaasili baata babali mu pasi, na nde ayilii kwaa baata boosi mamabwe.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Mundaa yatala bakwiili babafuru, asuusu pe bo mu litaanga la bakwiili. Mundaa ti nha manzala ma bo mali mu utsindi bo mu ukweele, bo bali mu utakuu na Kristo. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Mu yii, bo bali mu uholo tsieembili, mundaa ti bo aba bakebe pe imiini kia tsiomi ki bo basi kwaa Kristo. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Nha yulu a nhaa, bu bo bahele na isala kia usa, bo bali na ipfu kia uyooyene mu manzo-manzo. Ka kiabwavulu bubi, bo batoono utsuu mu bambaayi na bo matsweeyi pe. Bo bubaatsuu mu mandaa mahele utala bo. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Ni mu buu, me natoono ti bakwiili bakeni bafuru babwakweele, babutu baana, na basalila ma nzo ma bo. Mu yii, bo a buha pe mbuu kwaa Mutaata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mutaata </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni Saatina so a buu pe mudwaanisi a Yiisu na Ndaa Yimbwe.</char></note> mu utsuu bubi mu bisi. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Mundaa ti bakwiili bakimi ba bafuru, bamaasiisi kuulu yasuungunu mu uduku Saatina.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Ka so ngaa imiini li na bakwiili mu likaanda la nde, nde afwaana mu ubaasila bo, na anyaala uha mufunu kwaa libuundu. Mundaa ti, mufunu a libuundu ndila mu ubaasila bakwiili bali ngwanya bo bake.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Bakuutu ba libuundu bali mu ubiti libuundu bubwe, bafwaana uholo buzitu nha yulu a buzitu, vulu-vulu kwaa babali na mufunu waleme wa uyiisi mandaa a Nziaambi. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Mu ngwanya, Mabasonuu ma Ngira mali mu uleele: «Beni utuu pe udibuu munywa a ngoombo mu taanga dia utolo mbutu dia bele», na: «Musiali afwaana ubaa mufutu a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">nde </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Ndi 25.4</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 9:9">1Ko 9.9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10.7</ref></char></note>».<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />A siingi pe mifuundu mi busa mu mukutu a libuundu, mbiiti imbaangi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:15">Lit 19.15</ref></char></note> kia baata boolo so batata kio pe. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />So muutu siiri bubi, sieembe nde nha kulu a baata, paa ti bo ka bamono boomo. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Me ni yaabisa kwaa we nha kulu a Nziaambi, nha kulu a Yiisu Kristo na nha kulu a batumu ba Ngiraba nde asoolo: Tumumu mikele mi, kwahele a uba na imbisi a nzo, na a biingisi muutu so ndila mosi mu tala-kiinzi pe. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />A naa pe mio nha yulu a muutu mu mawasa, mu uha nde mufunu mutso libuundu. A ba pe itwaari mu masumu ma baata bakimi. Kebe tsieemini a we.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />A nywa ndila maamba pe, ka nywa mwaana a mala hoolo, mundaa moonyo wuli ubaakolo we. <verse eid="1TI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Masumu ma baata bamosi mali mu umonuu na yaki-yaki, tswaamina bufuundusu bo. Ka kwaa baata bana, ku mbisa pfuundisi mo mali mu uyabina. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Pili mosi ka, biyiluu bialuulu mu mamabwe bili mu uyabina na yaki-yaki, na so bibili keni a biayabina pe mu mawasa, a bituu pe uba biasweeme.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Nyaala baata boosi babali batee bakiinzi bapfumu ba bo mu likiinzi loosi. Paa ti, muutu so mosi anyaala utuu kuumbu a Nziaambi na nziisili a bisi. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />So batee bali na bapfumu bangaa imiini, a banyaala ukiinzi bo pe, mundaa ti bo bali baana ba nguu ba bo mu Kristo. Bo bafwaana uyiluu usalila bo. Mundaa ti, baata ba bo bali mu usalila, bali ba bangaa imiini ba mbaayi ba litoono <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6.9</ref></char></note> atoono.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Imiini mu Nziaambi ili busini ba ngwanya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Maa ni mandaa ma we kaayiisi na ma we kaatumu. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />So muutu yiisi nziisili kimi, na nde takii na mandaa masuungunu ma Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo na nziisili yafwaana na libweeye, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />nde li aluulu mu liwaa na bundimbi. Nde li na ibeeri kia utsuu na kia ukaama mu mii miatala bitoolo. Ni kuu kuli mu umata musoyi, makaama, mandaa ma utuu Nziaambi, matsimi mamabi ma muutu ahele uyiluu. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Na makaama mali mu uhele uwa nha kati a baata bali na matsimi matekene, bu bamaandiimbisi ngwanya. Bo bali mu utsimi ti, uba walibweeye yili kulu ya ubaa busini.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ee ngwanya, uba na libweeye lili busini ba bunene, so disiingi ndila biloo bidiabaa. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Mu ngwanya, bisi a diabee pe iloo so imosi mu tsi yi, na bisi a dituu ubiti iloo so imosi pe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Yob 1.21</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Ni mu buu, so bisi dili na biloo bia udia na bikutu, bii biakuu kwaa bisi. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Ka baata batoono uba bisini, bali mu ubwa mu mapuusu. Bo bali mu ukangama mu mieete mia ma nzala malaa, ma buwulu na mamabi mali mu ubiti babamosi ku pfuuyili na mali mu ukubu ndiimbisi a bo. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Mundaa ti litoono la mboongo, lili mwaanzi a mamabi moosi. Babamosi babayi nzala yalaa ya ubaa mboongo, ni mu buu bo batakii na imiini, na bo baloosi manyutu ma bo mu mapasi malaa.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi ma Pawuli kwaa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Ka we wuli mu isala kia Nziaambi, bata mandaa maa moosi! Saa bweeyili, ukangama mu Nziaambi, imiini, litoono, mukonono na buleembi. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Dwaana mudiingi wu mubwe wa imiini. Kaanga moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi wu we ayaali mbili. Ni mu nde we ati imbaangi ki ibwe kia imiini nha kulu a bambaangi balaa. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Nha kulu a Nziaambi, wuli mu uha moonyi kwaa biloo bioosi, na nha kulu a Yiisu Kristo, wati imbaangi ki ibwe kia imiini nha kulu a Ponse Pilato<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:36-37">Yow 18.36-37</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:11">19.11</ref></char></note>, me ndi mu utumu we mandaa ma: <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />tumumu mikele mia Nziaambi, kebe mio kutso tsieemini, na kwahele na bisieembi, natee mu iluumbu ki Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo akaamonuu. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Mii sa miyilimi mu taanga di Nziaambi atsimi, ndila nde Mutini wu munene, nde li idia kia makinyi, Mutini a mitini, na Pfumu a bapfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Ndi 10.17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:2">Mkg 104.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Ndili a nde wuli ukwa pe. Nde li mu udiaala kutso liyalila lili muutu so mosi utuu pe ubesine. A so muutu mosi pe wamaamono nde, na wu utuu umono<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:2">Mkg 104.2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 33:20">Pal 33.20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yow 1.18</ref></char></note> nde. Nyaala buzitu na litu la bilimi na bilimi biba ndila kwaa nde! Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Yaabisa kwaa babali na busini ba tsi yi, banyaala uba na liwaa. Leele kwaa bo, banyaala usuusu ilimbisi kia bo mu busini baa babuhele udiingi. Ka basuusu ilimbisi kia bo mu Nziaambi, wuli mu uha bisi bioosi mu iteesi kialaa, paa bisi diyaanga mu bio. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Leele kwaa bo mu uyiluu mimibwe, na uyiluu mioosi mu bubwe boosi, mu uha mu mutimi mosi na uyilimi mu ukaba kwaa babamosi. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Mu yii, bo sa bakukuu bomakulu busini weti ibwa mu taanga dikaayiri, paa babaa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoteo, nduu a me wa litoono, kebe bubwe-bubwe isala ki bahi we. Takuu na mandaa mahele na inziaambi, na mali itaata na imiini, na nziaabili ya pia. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Mu ngwanya, babamosi mu bo balasini ubaa nziaabili yii, ka bo batakii na imiini. Nyaala bweese ba Nziaambi buba na beni!<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>